                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="during the spring fair on the Wolverene River, I was present at a series of"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l4" HPOS="348" VPOS="642" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="348 681 2117 681" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="348 681 348 697 2115 697 2117 681 2113 646 1715 652 1617 642 1615 642 1551 652 1169 642 1167 642 1165 642 1124 652 1022 642 1020 642 1018 642 994 654 810 654 757 642 755 642 754 642 716 652 679 642 677 642 675 642 673 642 671 642 656 654 491 654 401 642 399 642 348 652 348 681"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="reindeer-races in the camps of the richest inhabitants. Two persons were all"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l5" HPOS="344" VPOS="699" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="64" BASELINE="346 744 2117 738" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="346 744 346 753 761 763 763 763 765 763 785 753 853 763 855 763 955 752 1249 752 1265 761 1267 761 1269 761 1271 761 1325 752 1363 761 1365 761 1367 761 1435 752 1470 761 1472 761 1474 761 1613 759 1615 759 1617 759 1631 750 1698 759 1700 759 2115 752 2117 738 2113 710 1682 699 1680 699 1678 699 1676 699 1660 708 1486 701 1484 701 1423 710 1370 701 1369 701 1367 701 1323 710 1271 701 1269 701 1267 701 1235 710 1155 701 1153 701 1086 710 1051 701 1049 701 1047 701 1045 701 1043 701 1028 710 624 703 622 703 556 712 473 703 472 703 425 712 368 703 366 703 364 703 362 703 344 710 346 744"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the time striving against each other for the victory. Their names were"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l6" HPOS="348" VPOS="755" WIDTH="1767" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="350 802 2115 797" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="350 802 350 816 2113 812 2115 797 2111 767 2015 755 2013 755 1929 765 1913 755 1911 755 1909 755 1907 755 1905 755 1903 755 1888 767 1776 767 1754 755 1752 755 1750 755 1748 755 1747 755 1731 765 1206 757 1204 757 1112 767 1024 757 1022 757 1020 757 998 769 348 769 350 802"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Toˊlɪño and Yaˊtirg̣ɪn. The reindeer of Toˊlɪño, however, were better than those"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l7" HPOS="344" VPOS="818" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="346 861 2117 857" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="346 861 346 873 2115 871 2117 857 2115 830 2077 818 2076 818 2074 818 2005 828 1940 818 1938 818 1936 818 1905 830 1570 830 1463 818 1461 818 1349 828 1296 818 1294 818 1292 818 1271 828 1239 818 1237 818 1235 818 1177 830 732 820 730 820 642 830 544 820 542 820 491 830 387 820 385 820 383 820 344 832 346 861"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of his rival, and he was victor several times. Then, at one race, the right"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l8" HPOS="344" VPOS="877" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="346 922 2115 916" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="346 922 346 936 2113 932 2115 916 2111 889 2029 877 2027 877 2025 877 1995 887 1631 877 1629 877 1521 889 1492 879 1490 879 1488 879 1065 889 936 879 934 879 871 891 397 881 395 881 393 881 344 893 346 922"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="reindeer of his team suddenly stumbled and fell, not fifty feet distant from"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l9" HPOS="346" VPOS="940" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="348 981 2117 977" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="348 981 348 992 1124 1002 1126 1002 1259 992 2115 992 2117 977 2111 940 726 949 628 940 626 940 569 949 532 940 530 940 528 940 423 949 370 940 368 940 366 940 364 940 346 947 348 981"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the goal, which gave to Yaˊtirg̣ɪn the chance to snatch the prize first. Of"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l10" HPOS="344" VPOS="998" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="346 1039 2115 1035" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="346 1039 346 1055 2113 1051 2115 1035 2111 1008 1239 998 1237 998 1235 998 1233 998 1220 1008 540 1000 538 1000 344 1010 346 1039"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="course, the accident was ascribed to a harmful incantation of the kind known"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l11" HPOS="344" VPOS="1057" WIDTH="1767" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="346 1102 2111 1098" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="346 1102 346 1114 2107 1120 2111 1098 2107 1071 2023 1057 2021 1057 1882 1069 1842 1057 1841 1057 1839 1057 1837 1057 1799 1069 1707 1057 1705 1057 1703 1057 1664 1069 1508 1057 1506 1057 1504 1057 1459 1069 1421 1057 1419 1057 1273 1057 1271 1057 1269 1057 1226 1071 1192 1059 1190 1059 1188 1059 1186 1059 1153 1071 1026 1059 1024 1059 1022 1059 1020 1059 1000 1073 673 1073 628 1059 626 1059 624 1059 622 1059 585 1071 567 1059 566 1059 564 1059 458 1059 456 1059 454 1059 452 1059 430 1073 344 1073 346 1102"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="as eiˊᵋut.¹ In my presence the uncle of Toˊlɪño, frightened by the accident,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l12" HPOS="344" VPOS="1120" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="346 1161 2113 1157" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="346 1161 346 1176 2111 1173 2113 1157 2109 1129 1253 1120 1251 1120 1249 1120 1216 1129 387 1122 385 1122 383 1122 344 1131 346 1161"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="tried to persuade him to stop racing and prepare for the return journey to his"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l13" HPOS="344" VPOS="1176" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="346 1222 2113 1216" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="346 1222 346 1235 2111 1235 2113 1216 2107 1180 1635 1186 1551 1176 1549 1176 1323 1188 1284 1178 1282 1178 1280 1178 1229 1188 1161 1178 1159 1178 1104 1188 1006 1178 1004 1178 652 1190 552 1180 550 1180 344 1192 346 1222"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="camp, which was two hundred miles distant. Toˊlɪño was obstinate, and"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l14" HPOS="344" VPOS="1237" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="346 1278 2113 1274" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="346 1278 346 1294 2111 1294 2113 1274 2107 1241 1564 1247 1515 1237 1513 1237 1511 1237 1486 1247 1435 1237 1433 1237 1431 1237 1429 1237 1414 1249 1318 1249 1229 1237 1227 1237 1226 1237 1198 1249 1102 1239 1100 1239 1030 1249 959 1239 957 1239 955 1239 953 1239 938 1251 830 1251 795 1239 793 1239 791 1239 611 1249 577 1239 575 1239 573 1239 571 1239 544 1249 519 1239 517 1239 364 1239 362 1239 360 1239 358 1239 344 1247 346 1278"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="determined to continue. Two days later, to the horror of all, Toˊlɪño died"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l15" HPOS="342" VPOS="1296" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="344 1341 2111 1335" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="344 1341 344 1355 2107 1359 2111 1335 2107 1306 1866 1296 1864 1296 1862 1296 1860 1296 1844 1308 1739 1308 1662 1296 1660 1296 1578 1306 1551 1296 1549 1296 1547 1296 1545 1296 1515 1308 1351 1298 1349 1298 1347 1298 1325 1310 971 1310 936 1298 934 1298 932 1298 930 1298 906 1310 844 1300 842 1300 548 1310 411 1300 409 1300 342 1310 344 1341"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="suddenly. The death, of course, was ascribed to the witchery of his rival;"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l16" HPOS="340" VPOS="1366" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="53" BASELINE="342 1402 2115 1398" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="342 1402 342 1411 2095 1419 2097 1419 2099 1419 2101 1419 2115 1410 2115 1398 2109 1366 340 1368 342 1402"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the more so, as the latter with his family left the country hastily on the next"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l17" HPOS="344" VPOS="1419" WIDTH="1765" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="344 1460 2109 1460" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="344 1460 344 1470 2107 1480 2109 1460 2109 1431 1635 1419 1633 1419 1555 1429 1478 1419 1476 1419 1474 1419 1441 1429 1343 1419 1341 1419 1259 1429 1222 1419 1220 1419 1218 1419 1216 1419 1182 1429 1116 1419 1114 1419 1112 1419 1073 1429 1022 1419 1020 1419 1018 1419 979 1429 897 1419 895 1419 893 1419 865 1431 573 1431 542 1419 540 1419 538 1419 399 1429 370 1419 368 1419 366 1419 364 1419 344 1429 344 1460"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="day, and went eastward in the direction of the Chaun River. In his haste,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l18" HPOS="342" VPOS="1474" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="344 1521 2113 1515" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="344 1521 344 1537 2111 1531 2113 1515 2109 1486 2060 1474 2058 1474 2056 1474 2034 1484 1972 1474 1970 1474 1895 1484 1876 1474 1874 1474 1872 1474 1870 1474 1868 1474 1852 1486 1698 1486 1609 1474 1607 1474 1519 1486 1472 1476 1470 1476 1468 1476 1445 1486 1421 1476 1419 1476 1417 1476 1416 1476 1392 1486 1357 1476 1355 1476 1353 1476 1351 1476 1323 1486 1290 1476 1288 1476 1286 1476 1284 1476 1257 1486 1210 1476 1208 1476 1206 1476 1177 1486 1086 1476 1085 1476 1083 1476 1053 1486 969 1476 967 1476 965 1476 928 1490 795 1490 779 1478 777 1478 775 1478 773 1478 771 1478 746 1488 720 1478 718 1478 716 1478 663 1488 648 1478 646 1478 644 1478 642 1478 342 1484 344 1521"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="he even left behind a part of his large herd of reindeer, which were taken by the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l19" HPOS="340" VPOS="1535" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="342 1582 2113 1574" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="342 1582 342 1596 2111 1590 2113 1574 2109 1547 1829 1535 1827 1535 1723 1545 1700 1535 1698 1535 1696 1535 1694 1535 1662 1547 1637 1537 1635 1537 1633 1537 1631 1537 1609 1549 1410 1549 1376 1537 1374 1537 1372 1537 1370 1537 1329 1547 1249 1537 1247 1537 1245 1537 1220 1549 924 1539 922 1539 877 1549 844 1539 842 1539 840 1539 763 1551 699 1541 697 1541 493 1551 354 1541 352 1541 350 1541 348 1541 340 1545 342 1582"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="family of the deceased. The brother of the latter promised to visit, the next"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_2-214_l20" HPOS="342" VPOS="1598" WIDTH="1389" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="344 1637 1731 1641" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="344 1637 342 1648 362 1658 364 1658 366 1658 1030 1650 1039 1658 1039 1660 1041 1660 1043 1660 1045 1660 1729 1650 1731 1641 1729 1611 1390 1599 1388 1599 1386 1599 1351 1609 1316 1599 1314 1599 1312 1599 1130 1609 1094 1599 1092 1599 1090 1599 1039 1609 983 1598 981 1598 979 1598 953 1609 867 1609 855 1598 853 1598 851 1598 850 1598 344 1605 344 1637"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="fall, the country of Chaun in order to settle the blood-score."/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
