                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="340 2177 340 2195 2105 2195 2105 2177 2105 2146 2089 2138 2087 2138 2085 2138 2083 2138 2001 2150 1715 2150 1700 2138 1698 2138 1696 2138 1592 2138 1590 2138 1588 2138 1586 2138 1572 2148 1558 2138 1557 2138 1555 2138 1553 2138 1484 2150 1361 2150 1339 2138 1337 2138 1335 2138 1251 2148 1194 2138 1192 2138 1190 2138 1157 2148 340 2144 340 2177"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="his right, and after some controversy the affair was settled without even weregild."/>
                    </TextLine>
